{"title":"Contacts","lang":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"Part one","links":[]},{"kind":"heading","text":"Contacts","links":[]},{"kind":"heading","text":"Our contacts","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Welcome to our website.Here are the communication channels, we will be happy to answer your question","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"+996 (312) 21-86-59Rector's Reception","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"+996 (312) 54-32-21","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"+996 (708) 77-78-75Mobile","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"+996 (772) 37-32-38Mobile 2","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"+996 (312) 42-47-54College","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"+996 (312) 54-32-31INDO","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Bishkek, Chyngyz Aitmatov Avenue 27","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Facebook","links":[{"label":"Facebook","href":"http://facebook.com/people/%D0%91%D0%93%D0%A3-%D0%B8%D0%BC-%D0%9A-%D0%9A%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B0/61574565820684/"}]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Instagram","links":[{"label":"Instagram","href":"https://www.instagram.com/bsu_karasaev/"}]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Link","links":[{"label":"Link","href":"/admissions/content/921a7c1434df"}]},{"kind":"image","href":"/migration-files/9304a88abaf39158d5cdf5e2791911fd50831a3b9437c31e2349748cea3eb25f.jpg","text":"Контакты"},{"kind":"text","text":"Part two (administration, confirm the information!)","links":[]},{"kind":"heading","text":"Frequently asked questions","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"BSU offers a wide range of humanities programs:","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Linguistics and Translation Studies (Eastern and Western Languages)","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Pedagogy and psychology","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"International Relations and Political Science","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Journalism and media communications","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Sociology and cultural studies","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Economics and Management","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"A full list of programs is available on our website in the section [For applicants].","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Yes! BSU offers English-language programs in international relations, economics, and linguistics. Intensive English courses are also available for all majors.","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Every year, 500+ students participate in exchange programs with partner universities:","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Grants for study abroad","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Asia: Soka (Japan), Guangzhou (China), Seoul (Korea)","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Europe and USA: Pittsburgh (USA), Moscow State University (Russia), etc.","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"To enter you must:","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Submit documents (certificate, passport, photo)","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Pass entrance examinations (depending on the specialty)","links":[]},{"kind":"bullet","text":"Pass the competitive selection","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Detailed instructions are in the section [Admissions Committee].","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Certificate of proficiency in the language of instruction (if required)","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Nostrified certificate/diploma","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Medical certificate","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Copy of passport","links":[]},{"kind":"text","text":"Yes, out-of-town and international students are offered comfortable dormitories near campus.","links":[]}],"variants":[{"id":"4eb950636535","lang":"ru","title":"Контакты"},{"id":"4eb950636535-ky-23481","lang":"ky","title":"Байланыштар"},{"id":"4eb950636535-en-5f97f","lang":"en","title":"Contacts"},{"id":"4eb950636535-cn-edcf7","lang":"cn","title":"联系方式"}]}